          "python",
          "=== PCA on Rating Matrix ===\nOriginal shape: (30, 15)\nReduced shape:  (30, 5)\n\nExplained variance ratio per component:\n  PC1: 0.3524 |#################\n  PC2: 0.2891 |##############\n  PC3: 0.1456 |#######\n  PC4: 0.0623 |###\n  PC5: 0.0412 |##\n\nTotal variance explained (5 components): 0.8906\n\n--- User Clusters in 2D Projection ---\nUser         PC1      PC2 Cluster\n----------------------------------------\nUser_1      3.234    1.567 Action\nUser_6      2.890    1.234 Action\nUser_11    -2.456    2.890 Drama\nUser_16    -2.123    2.567 Drama\nUser_21    -0.567   -3.456 Animation\nUser_26    -0.234   -3.123 Animation"
